 "statement": "Fixed native public-input reference: all13 declared Fp101 image targets return original six-member roots with full TargetCircuit and indexed-row replay; all185760 full-family/compressed disjoint-completion comparisons agree (160160 toy and25600 actual six-column). First-witness-only lookup misses59384 toy completions, a per-lookup result rather than whole-target solver-failure claim. Toy12320 signed half-triples retain260 original witnesses over13 sum keys, max20 per key; actual six-column fixture retains160 over160 keys. Actual arity2/4/6 known-answer targets replay; RFC u9 target exhausts that exact six-column base, independently agreeing with all64 sign assignments and zero roots. Listed malformed/resource controls reject. Standard Vandermonde identity IDC1hd26c4be98ace1e7d is native-evaluated over the declared Mersenne field with corrupted-identity refusal, not formal proof. Focused release test/fmt/strict Clippy pass; seven compiled-in hashes and composite50-source snapshot match. These are producer-local finite controls, not a full actual-base solve, novel representative-family method, subquadratic solver, admitted performance result or signed scientific validation."
